# Fused backport of vllm-project/vllm#40750 + #40611 for vLLM v0.23.0.
#
# Combines and supersedes the previous multi-patch stack:
#   0001-pr40750-dcp-fp8-triton-mla.patch  (--forward, 3 hunks silently failed)
#   0002-dcp-fp8-fixes.patch               (supplemented failed hunks)
#   0003-eagle-draft-dcp-override.patch     (PR #40611 draft model DCP override)
#   0005-dcp-fp8-token-to-seq-v0230-fix.patch (fix: padded_local_token_to_seq crash)
#
# This single patch applies cleanly against v0.23.0 with plain `patch -p1`
# (no --forward, no .rej deletion).  All hunks have been rewritten to match
# v0.23.0's code structure:
#   - Uses _ChunkedMetadata instead of chunked_context_metadata_cls (which
#     doesn't exist in v0.23.0; it was introduced in a later vLLM version)
#   - Computes padded_local_token_to_seq + padded_local_chunk_total_token in
#     the DCP build path and passes them to ChunkedContextMetadata, fixing
#     the `assert token_to_seq is not None` crash under concurrent prefill
#     with --kv-cache-dtype fp8 + --decode-context-parallel-size > 1
#   - Removes `assert k_scale is None` (DCP+fp8 now supported)
#   - Adds draft_kv_cache_dtype / draft_attention_backend / draft_parallel_config
#     to SpeculativeConfig (PR #40611)
#   - Adds maybe_override_cp_for_vllm_config to flash_attn and flashinfer backends
#   - Adds VLLM_ENABLE_PCIE_ALLREDUCE env var
#
# Files NOT included in this patch (applied as full file copies in Dockerfile):
#   - vllm/v1/attention/backends/mla/triton_mla.py         (full replacement)
#   - vllm/v1/attention/backends/mla/triton_mla_tuning.py  (new file)
#
# Upstream PRs:
#   https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/40750  (DCP + fp8 + TRITON_MLA MTP)
#   https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/40609  (fp8 KV cache with DCP)
#   https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/40611  (Eagle 3.1 draft model)
# Tested against: vllm v0.23.0 (vllm/vllm-openai:v0.23.0-ubuntu2404)

